sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant B as Firmware / Bootloader
participant K as Kernel
participant D as Drivers
participant I as PID 1
participant S as Services
participant A as Qt app
Note over B,A: T0–T1: power và firmware
B->>B: Nạp Image, DTB, bootargs
B->>K: T2: chuyển quyền
K->>K: Memory, interrupts, scheduler
K->>D: T3: match và probe
Note over K,D: Probe có thể deferred hoặc asynchronous
alt Có initramfs
K->>I: /init trong RAM
I->>D: Chuẩn bị root device
I->>I: Mount rootfs, exec switch_root sang main init
else Không initramfs
K->>K: Mount main rootfs
K->>I: Chạy main init
end
Note over I: T4: main userspace
I->>S: T5: khởi động theo dependency
par USB
S->>D: Udev subscription và enumerate
and CAN
S->>D: SocketCAN setup
and Display
I->>D: Chờ connector, tạo KMS config
end
I->>A: T6: exec player
A->>A: Libraries, C++ objects, QML
A->>D: T7: first UI frame
S-->>A: T8: playlist / IPC
A->>D: Read, decode và render
Note over B,A: T9: first media frame